62: -- Campaign payload is visible to the owner and approved members. Approved players
63: -- may update shared play state; only the owner may create or delete a campaign.
64: drop policy if exists seed_campaigns_read_members on public.seed_campaigns;
65: create policy seed_campaigns_read_members on public.seed_campaigns
66:   for select to authenticated using (
